      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Although this new Japanese text parallels the humor of the original text, it does carry one minor side effect: it makes some level of sense for a comedian to practice knock-knock jokes while standing in front of a giant door, but it makes less sense to practice generic comedy in the same situation.",
        "raw": "Although this new Japanese text parallels the humor of the original text, it\ndoes carry one minor side effect: it makes some level of sense for a comedian to\npractice knock-knock jokes while standing in front of a giant door, but it makes\nless sense to practice generic comedy in the same situation.",
